<ContentPage
  title="Privacy Policy | SpedCentral"
  description="How SpedCentral collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lastUpdated="July 27, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains what information SpedCentral, Inc. ("SpedCentral," "we," "us") collects when you
    use spedcentral.com (the "Site"), and how we use, share, and protect it.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect information in a few ways:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us directly:</strong> your name, email, phone number, and message when you contact a provider, submit a listing, or reach out to us.</li>
    <li><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong> standard technical data like your browser type, device, and pages visited, typically collected via cookies or similar technology once analytics are enabled -- see our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Information from providers:</strong> business and credential information submitted by providers listing their practice.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To connect you with a provider or answer your inquiry;</li>
    <li>To review and publish provider listings;</li>
    <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Site;</li>
    <li>To communicate with you about your inquiry or account, if applicable;</li>
    <li>To detect and prevent fraud or misuse of the Site.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2>3. Who we share information with</h2>
  <p>
    We share information with the specific provider you contact (so they can respond to you), and with service
    providers who help us run the Site -- for example, database hosting (Supabase), file/image storage and content
    delivery (Cloudflare), and site hosting (Vercel). These providers only process data on our behalf and under
    their own security obligations. We may also disclose information if required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Your choices &amp; rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us what personal information we have about you, request a correction, or request deletion at any
    time by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@spedcentral.com">hello@spedcentral.com</a>. Depending on your state of
    residence, you may have additional rights under laws like the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA); we honor
    those requests regardless of where you live.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>
    SpedCentral is intended for use by parents, caregivers, and professionals -- not by children. We do not
    knowingly collect personal information directly from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us
    personal information, contact us and we'll delete it.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Data security</h2>
  <p>
    We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information. No method of transmission
    or storage is 100% secure, and we can't guarantee absolute security.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep contact and inquiry information only as long as needed to respond to you and maintain accurate
    records, and provider listing information for as long as the listing remains active plus a reasonable period
    after removal.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will update the "Last updated" date
    above.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy or your data? Email <a href="mailto:hello@spedcentral.com">hello@spedcentral.com</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
